      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please know that feeling guilty for not feeling grateful during good times is a heavy burden to carry. These feelings of being \"stuck\" and feeling like you're just existing are hallmarks of deep emotional exhaustion. Instead of aiming to force large bursts of feeling, perhaps the initial goal could be aiming for neutral awareness or a moment of true stillness. Reaching out to a professional specializing in existential distress might offer a different path than previous attempts.",
